          "post_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/suttons-transport-group_starawards-personalresponsibility-suttonsinternational-activity-7381322311318269952-UBxa?utm_source=social_share_send&utm_medium=member_desktop_web&rcm=ACoAAF-W80UBX-XPoTYww8ZGC31eGuzycdJM0mM",
          "text": "Congratulations to Xero Wang, who has been recognised with a Star Award for Personal Responsibility.\n \nIn December, Xero played a pivotal role in coordinating a large-scale tank campaign between Europe and China for one of our key customers. During the operation, a complex logistics challenge arose that required swift action and careful coordination across multiple parties.\n \nXero took full ownership of the situation, working closely with tank planners to identify suitable equipment, liaising with suppliers to manage the necessary product transfers and technical procedures, and keeping both the customer and receivers fully informed throughout.\n \nHis proactive approach, attention to detail, and commitment to maintaining the highest standards of safety and service ensured the campaign was completed successfully and on schedule.\n \nXero’s dedication, particularly over the festive period, is a fantastic example of Personal Responsibility in action, taking initiative, leading by example, and delivering excellence for our customers.\n  \n#StarAwards #PersonalResponsibility #SuttonsInternational #CoreValues #ChemicalIndustry #LogisticsIndustry",
