          "text": "Our teams in China recently came together to celebrate the 76th anniversary of Chinese National Day. The occasion was made even more special by combining it with October birthday celebrations, creating a festive and inclusive atmosphere.\n \nThe team enjoyed a relaxed tea break together, strengthening connections and team spirit. The event also featured a “Let’s Talk Colours” training session, where the team explored four different personality types and reflected on how to adapt communication styles when working with diverse teams. \n \nIt was a fantastic day of celebration, learning, and collaboration, a great reflection of the energy and within our China team!\n \n#ChinaNationalDay #SuttonsInternational #Teamwork #Collaboration #ChemicalIndustry #ChemicalLogistics #LogisticsIndustry",
